      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that helps a lot. i'm just worried that if i move too fast, they'll realize i'm onto them and ramp up the pressure. like, if i start saving everything, they might try to corner me or make it even harder to work there. do you think there's any way to tell if they're already monitoring my digital activity or communications to see if i'm looking for a lawyer? i just want to stay one step ahead of this \"erasure\" thing.",
